<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers 500 bln yen in 2.0 pct 6-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers 500 bln yen in 2.0 pct 6-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday that it was offering 500 billion yen worth of 2.0 percent six-year bonds through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be November 20 and the maturity date will be November 20, 2002.</p>
</text>
